     "body": "<p>The next PR: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/ontology/pull/16\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/ontology/pull/16</a></p>\n\n<p>This changes the repository:repository* properties to camelCase (from.dot.notation)</p>\n\n<p>It also capitalizes certain owl:Class names such as repository:configuration, repository:nodeConfiguration and repository:relations</p>\n\n<p>A corresponding PR for fcrepo4 is forthcoming</p>",
